msgstr "RTCD를 배포하기 전에, 다음을 갖추었는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup.md:12
msgid "A Mattermost Enterprise license"
msgstr "Mattermost Enterprise 라이선스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup.md:13
msgid ""
